246	  // ── Atomically check conflicts and insert within a serialized transaction ──
247	  // A PostgreSQL advisory lock (per court+date) blocks any concurrent booking attempt
248	  // for the same court on the same day, making the read-then-write conflict check atomic.
249	  class BookingConflictError extends Error {
